Z||000003||Greg Piet||09-11-2000||01:09 AM||||I give you a year and I think your "balls to the walls" plan will change...<BR>There are times you need to drive slower to get a better time, which I am still having problems keeping into my thick skull. <BR>But the most important thing is "did you have fun?" which seems to be the solo 2 guideline!||||reg||1
